1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,219
Look at how the book opens.

2
00:00:01,242 --> 00:00:06,931
This is the record of the genealogy of Jesus Christ, the son of David, the son of Abraham.

3
00:00:07,256 --> 00:00:12,399
Son of Abraham. That is the family through whom God promised to bless every nation on earth.

4
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:16,265
Son of David. That is the family of Israel&#8217;s king.

5
00:00:17,217 --> 00:00:22,012
So the long list of names that follows is not a preface to the story. It is the first argument of it.

